{"v":"0ffc6509ea0b","iter":150000,"login":{"riddle":"I follow you all day but vanish in the dark. Give me a shape and I will not leave you. What am I?"},"rooms":[{"id":"r1","name":"The Threshold","blurb":"The first corridor. Brass doors, a smell of old paper, and locks that were considered gentle by the people who made them.","puzzles":["r1p1","r1p2","r1p3","r1p4","r1p5","r1p6","r1p7","r1p8","r1p9","r1p10"],"meta":"m1","gate":"login"},{"id":"r2","name":"The Scriptorium","blurb":"Rows of desks with lamps still lit. The scribes wrote in many hands and sealed their work in many ways.","puzzles":["r2p1","r2p2","r2p3","r2p4","r2p5","r2p6","r2p7","r2p8","r2p9","r2p10"],"meta":"m2","gate":"m1"},{"id":"r3","name":"The Signal Hall","blurb":"Speakers, antennas, drawers of wire. Every message here was once a sound or a flicker.","puzzles":["r3p1","r3p2","r3p3","r3p4","r3p5","r3p6","r3p7","r3p8","r3p9","r3p10"],"meta":"m3","gate":"m2"},{"id":"r4","name":"The Engine Works","blurb":"Gears, valves, and machines that do exactly what they are told, no more and no less.","puzzles":["r4p1","r4p2","r4p3","r4p4","r4p5","r4p6","r4p7","r4p8","r4p9","r4p10"],"meta":"m4","gate":"m3"},{"id":"r5","name":"The Counting Vaults","blurb":"Abacus, ledger, slate. The clerks believed that every question has an exact answer, if you are patient enough or clever enough.","puzzles":["r5p1","r5p2","r5p3","r5p4","r5p5","r5p6","r5p7","r5p8","r5p9","r5p10"],"meta":"m5","gate":"m4"},{"id":"r6","name":"The Cipher Bank","blurb":"The strongroom of the cartographers' guild. The locks are the best of their age, and each has a flaw its maker never saw.","puzzles":["r6p1","r6p2","r6p3","r6p4","r6p5","r6p6","r6p7","r6p8","r6p9","r6p10"],"meta":"m6","gate":"m5"},{"id":"r7","name":"The Gallery of Grids","blurb":"Framed puzzles on every wall, each with exactly one right answer, and no place where guessing pays.","puzzles":["r7p1","r7p2","r7p3","r7p4","r7p5","r7p6","r7p7","r7p8","r7p9","r7p10"],"meta":"m7","gate":"m6"},{